{"id":"int-d605287ac1831d08111a22dbb2154d61","kind":"field_change","created_at":"2026-09-12T22:46:13.485446Z","actor":"Jakob Priesner","issue_id":"culina-v2-ddp","extra":{"field":"status","new_value":"closed","old_value":"open","reason":"Migration 0006_shopping, the repository, and the write path are in place. Deviations from the sketch, on purpose: section guesses live in a keyword table in code (SectionKeywords) with per-household corrections in shopping_section_overrides, rather than a seeded ingredient_section_seed table — a seed that ships in a migration cannot be corrected without another migration. Item provenance (shopping_list_item_sources) is not stored: nothing in the UI asks which recipe a line came from, and merged amounts make the answer plural anyway. Writes now run in one transaction, which the sketch called for."}}
